# A text box whose parent also holds its label and a Copy button: ArrowDown from Copy reached the box, but the ring went round the whole group, Copy included, so it seemed not to have moved, and ArrowUp, measured from the group's top, skipped Copy. The ring goes round the box, the arrows measure from it, and Enter still goes in.
pages/confirm-phrase-group.html
start:css=#copy
key:ArrowDown
expect-ring:css=#confirm-input
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#copy
key:ArrowDown
expect-ring:css=#confirm-input
key:Enter
type:restore orchard
eval:(() => { const v = document.getElementById('confirm-input').value; if (v !== 'restore orchard') throw new Error(v); return v; })()
